OL,3,AFires break out at French schools as
OL,4,Astudents protest nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents are protesting about a lack of
OL,7,Fteachers and staff, overcrowded
OL,8,Fclassrooms and run-down buildings.
OL,9,FUniversity students joined the
OL,10,Fdemonstrations on Thursday, citing
OL,11,Fsimilar demands.
OL,13,FThe interior ministry said 1,949 people
OL,14,Fhad been arrested on Thursday, with 305
OL,15,Fpolice officers injured. Prime Minister
OL,16,FSebastien Lecornu held a crisis meeting
OL,17,Fon Thursday to discuss the unrest.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
